[[Garlic]] is a [[Food]] item available in the shop to all characters, at common rarity. It slowly gives {{icon/block}}, and also has a chance to remove {{icon/vampirism}}. While normally not a particularly efficient [[Food]], with the [[Smelly Wall]] skill, [[Garlic]] nearby more than doubles its {{icon/block}} generation, and this {{icon/block}} gain also gives {{icon/poison}}, vastly raising the power of any [[Garlic]] the character may have.
